# ==============================================================================
# HexChat (.NET / Avalonia) - Local Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# Copy this file to '.env' and fill in your GitHub Personal Access Token (PAT).
# The '.env' file is ignored by Git and will NEVER be committed.
#
# Recommended Token Type: Fine-grained Personal Access Token
# Repository: baerenbude-org/hexchat
# Required Permissions:
#   - Actions: Read-only (check CI/CD runs & test logs)
#   - Pull requests: Read-only (or Read and write)
#   - Issues: Read-only (or Read and write)
#   - Dependabot alerts: Read-only
#   - Code scanning alerts: Read-only
#   - Secret scanning alerts: Read-only
#
# Alternatively: Classic Personal Access Token with scopes:
#   repo, workflow, security_events
# ==============================================================================

GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_your_token_here
GITHUB_REPOSITORY=baerenbude-org/hexchat
